01:05:35.030 --> 01:05:37.190
And then Oscar had to wear it as a, as a shirt.

1138
01:05:37.290 --> 01:05:37.550
Yeah.

1139
01:05:38.870 --> 01:05:45.670
Well, Angela in real life really likes animals who are dressed in costumes of other animals.

1140
01:05:45.950 --> 01:05:47.490
I mean, it's very similar.

1141
01:05:47.690 --> 01:05:50.290
It's very similar to liking babies dressed as adults.

1142
01:05:50.290 --> 01:05:50.830
I think.

1143
